{"id":"n66583-1-7","stage":1,"title":"주위 · 周围","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n66583-1-7-1","ko":"너 눈 주위에 왜 이렇게 멍이 들었어?","zh":"你眼睛周围怎么会有这么多淤青啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"눈","meaning":"眼睛","explanation":"눈：眼睛","readings":[{"term":"눈","audio":"/audio/ab1b14816087979d2143.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72704","senseId":"1","lemma":"눈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"주위에","meaning":"周围","explanation":"주위：周围；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"주위","audio":"/audio/9776611139b2a008d05e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66583","senseId":"1","lemma":"주위","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이렇게","meaning":"这样","explanation":"이렇다：这样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"이렇다","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71157","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"멍이","meaning":"青块，淤青","explanation":"멍：青块，淤青；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"멍","audio":"/audio/bd9899a4316fe5ab25a2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"54990","senseId":"1","lemma":"멍","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"들었어?","meaning":"出现、形成（멍이 들다：出现淤青）","explanation":"들다：出现、形成（멍이 들다：出现淤青）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"들다","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71686","senseId":"21","lemma":"들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"ab1b14816087979d","term":"눈","zh":"眼睛","audio":"/audio/ab1b14816087979d2143.mp3","entryId":"72704","definition":"人或动物的一种感觉器官，位于脸部，受光线刺激后能看到物体。","pronunciation":["눈"]},{"id":"9776611139b2a008","term":"주위","zh":"周围","audio":"/audio/9776611139b2a008d05e.mp3","entryId":"66583","definition":"围住某地的周边。","pronunciation":["주위"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"c2f95cfd19c5a89b","term":"이렇다","zh":"这样","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3","entryId":"71157","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["이러타"]},{"id":"bd9899a4316fe5ab","term":"멍","zh":"青块，淤青","audio":"/audio/bd9899a4316fe5ab25a2.mp3","entryId":"54990","definition":"由于挨碰或挨打，皮下出现淤血的现象。","pronunciation":["멍"]},{"id":"7ff37822e89462ea","term":"들다","zh":"出现、形成（멍이 들다：出现淤青）","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3","entryId":"71686","definition":"出现、形成（멍이 들다：出现淤青）","pronunciation":["들다"]}],"audio":"/audio/40246f459ef786df59e1.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n66583-1-7-2","ko":"농구하다가 다쳤어. 그래도 다행히 눈은 안 다쳤어.","zh":"打篮球时受伤的。不过幸好眼睛没受伤。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"농구하다가","meaning":"篮球；做，干","explanation":"농구：篮球；하다：做，干；다가：表示原有动作或状态中途转为另一情况。","readings":[{"term":"농구","audio":"/audio/ee488a636544e5f46302.mp3"},{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28323","senseId":"1","lemma":"농구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다쳤어.","meaning":"受伤，负伤，弄伤","explanation":"다치다：受伤，负伤，弄伤；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"다치다","audio":"/audio/128510caa5a5a0b67924.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73400","senseId":"1","lemma":"다치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그래도","meaning":"“그리하여도(